  "details": "As the title suggests, with the regular camera, we have a depth mode. In the multi-layer mode, the camera focuses to infinity and saves three images (composite, background only, and avatar only). A fourth image with the exposed depth map will be incredibly useful during photo editing in post-production. Furthermore, it will empower users to control the focus point in post-editing and have more command over the scene in software such as Photoshop and similar applications that support depth maps.",
